url: "https://jaxtronomy.github.io/spexial"
repository-artifact: "https://pypi.org/project/spexial/"
abstract: >-
  spexial provides special functions for JAX, following the
  scipy.special API. The implementations are written in terms
  of JAX primitives, so they compose with jit compilation,
  automatic differentiation and vectorisation, and run on CPU,
  GPU and TPU. spexial fills gaps in jax.scipy.special and
  extends some routines beyond their scipy counterparts, for
  example gamma to negative real arguments and zeta to negative
  integers. Several routines originate in the LINX code, and the complex
  Spence function is translated from scipy's Cython implementation.
keywords:
  - special-functions
  - jax
